下面的写法让蓝图可以绕过校验直接改生命值，请按原文“默认只读 + 受控写入”改一版：

UCLASS()
class UMyHealthComponent : public UActorComponent
{
    GENERATED_BODY()
public:
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, BlueprintReadWrite, Category = "Health")
    float Health = 100.f;
};

items.ref:
改成私有 + 蓝图只读 + 允许私有访问，写入收口到一个带校验的函数：

UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = "Health")
void ApplyDamage(float Amount);

private:
    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, BlueprintReadOnly, Category = "Health",
              meta = (AllowPrivateAccess = "true", ClampMin = "0.0", UIMax = "100.0"))
    float Health = 100.f;

`ApplyDamage` 里统一做 `FMath::Clamp`、死亡判断和广播。判定要点：私有属性必须配 `meta=(AllowPrivateAccess="true")`；能不给 `BlueprintReadWrite` 就不给；`ClampMin`/`UIMax` 只作用于编辑器输入与滑条显示，不替代运行时校验。

